{
  "file_id": "3526",
  "text_count": 147,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "We did all that running away from\nthe Numemon, I'm thirsty...",
      "_offset": 6786,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "But we won't be lucky enough to\nfind drinks around here.",
      "_offset": 6848,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "I never expected to find vending\nmachines here! There's so many!",
      "_offset": 6908,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Mimi, you're not thinking of\ngetting a drink, are you?",
      "_offset": 6973,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Of course I am!",
      "_offset": 7028,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "We're not gonna find juice just\nlike that!",
      "_offset": 7044,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Really...?",
      "_offset": 7087,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Oh, well, she's still like a\nchild.",
      "_offset": 7098,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Hmph, this vending machine doesn't\nhave cola. I wanna drink cola!",
      "_offset": 7134,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "This is great! I want some cola,\ntoo!",
      "_offset": 7200,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "How about we split it 50-50?",
      "_offset": 7238,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "I'll give you all of it.",
      "_offset": 7267,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Are you sure?",
      "_offset": 7292,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Yeah, it tastes better when you\ndon't drink it alone.",
      "_offset": 7306,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "I'll let you have all of it.",
      "_offset": 7360,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "You shouldn't give me all of it.",
      "_offset": 7389,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Don't worry! You're the youngest,\nafter all.",
      "_offset": 7422,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "I really don't want to be treated\nlike that.",
      "_offset": 7467,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "I said you shouldn't worry...",
      "_offset": 7512,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Thanks! Mimi, you're really nice.",
      "_offset": 7542,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Cola, huh...I haven't had that in\na while.",
      "_offset": 7576,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "How about we split it 50-50?",
      "_offset": 7619,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "I only have 100 yen at the moment.",
      "_offset": 7648,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Don't worry about me. It'd be bad\nform if I leeched off others.",
      "_offset": 7683,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "I'm not worried about that!",
      "_offset": 7747,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "I'm sorry! If I had more than 100\nyen on me, I'd buy more than one.",
      "_offset": 7775,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "It's all right. You don't need to\nspend money on me.",
      "_offset": 7843,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Is cola really that tasty?",
      "_offset": 7896,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "It's very tasty! And it's\nrefreshing, too!",
      "_offset": 7923,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Wow!",
      "_offset": 7966,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "So you like cola, Mimi?",
      "_offset": 7971,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "You don't?",
      "_offset": 7995,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "I'm more of a tea person.",
      "_offset": 8006,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "You're weird, Jou!",
      "_offset": 8032,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Is that how you think of me?",
      "_offset": 8051,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "How could anyone like tea more\nthan cola?",
      "_offset": 8080,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Doesn't look like there are any\nvending machines beyond here...",
      "_offset": 8126,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Mimi, that's enough. Let's keep\ngoing!",
      "_offset": 8190,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Mimi, that's enough. Let's keep\ngoing!",
      "_offset": 8229,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "I can't walk, I'm still too\nthirsty!",
      "_offset": 8268,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Okay, but hurry up.",
      "_offset": 8305,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "I found it! There's a vending\nmachine! I'm gonna drink some\nbubbling, sparkling cola!",
      "_offset": 8325,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Missy!!",
      "_offset": 8411,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Kyaaaah!!",
      "_offset": 8419,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Wanna go on a date?",
      "_offset": 8429,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Another Numemon?",
      "_offset": 8449,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "He's trying to hit on you, Mimi.\nWhat are you gonna do?",
      "_offset": 8466,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Definitely not! Why would I go out\nwith a thing like that?!",
      "_offset": 8522,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "A thing? Why are you calling me a\nthing? Now I'm angry! Hey,\neveryone, let's attack her!",
      "_offset": 8582,
      "_length": 88,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "W-what's this?!",
      "_offset": 8671,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "So many Numemon...",
      "_offset": 8687,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "They've surrounded us!",
      "_offset": 8706,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Yamato!",
      "_offset": 8729,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Kyaaaaah! They're throwing poop at\nus!",
      "_offset": 8737,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "If we stay together, we'll just be\neasy targets for them!",
      "_offset": 8776,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Okay, we'll split up, run, and\nmeet up later! Let's go!",
      "_offset": 8834,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Nu~~~~!!",
      "_offset": 8890,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Mimi, get behind me!",
      "_offset": 8899,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Palmon, will you be okay?",
      "_offset": 8920,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Nunu~~",
      "_offset": 8949,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "_offset": 8956,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "That was amazing, Palmon!",
      "_offset": 8961,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "That's weird, I didn't even do\nanything yet...",
      "_offset": 8987,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Kyah!",
      "_offset": 9034,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "What's going on? The earth's\nshaking...",
      "_offset": 9040,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Missy! Get over here and hide!",
      "_offset": 9080,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Something's coming! We need to\nhide!",
      "_offset": 9111,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "What? What? What's coming!?",
      "_offset": 9148,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Welcome to Toy Town.",
      "_offset": 9184,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "I am Toy Town's mayor. I love the\ntoys and they love me.",
      "_offset": 9205,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "That's so cool! He must be a good\nDigimon!",
      "_offset": 9262,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "He should be, but...",
      "_offset": 9305,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "It's a trick. He's been acting\nweird lately...for some reason.",
      "_offset": 9326,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Let's play together, everyone.",
      "_offset": 9389,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "He left...",
      "_offset": 9420,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "He said \"let's play together,\neveryone\", so maybe everyone's in\nToy Town.",
      "_offset": 9431,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Let's go!",
      "_offset": 9505,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Are we going on a date in Toy\nTown?",
      "_offset": 9515,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "It's not a date! We're going to\nlook for everyone!",
      "_offset": 9551,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Mimi, wait!",
      "_offset": 9602,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Such a blunt girl.",
      "_offset": 9614,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Ah!!",
      "_offset": 9633,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "There's Toy Town!",
      "_offset": 9638,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Wow! It looks just like an\namusement park!",
      "_offset": 9656,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Mimi...You remember why we came\nhere, right?",
      "_offset": 9699,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Right...we were trying to meet up\nwith everyone.",
      "_offset": 9744,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Let's stay on track and look for\nthem!",
      "_offset": 9793,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Mimi! We won't find anything by\ngoing that way!",
      "_offset": 9832,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "It's not this way?",
      "_offset": 9880,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Taichi! I'm so glad you're okay!",
      "_offset": 9899,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "This is fun, this is fun!",
      "_offset": 9932,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "I don't see anything fun.",
      "_offset": 9958,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "I'm super-super-super-happy!",
      "_offset": 9984,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "This isn't like you at all,\nYamato!",
      "_offset": 10013,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Mimi, something's got to be behind\nthis.",
      "_offset": 10049,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Sora! I'm so glad to see you here!",
      "_offset": 10090,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "This is really, really fun!",
      "_offset": 10125,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "What's so fun about it?",
      "_offset": 10153,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Why is Sora acting like this?",
      "_offset": 10177,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Koushirou! I've been looking for\nyou!",
      "_offset": 10207,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "I'm happy, I'm happy!",
      "_offset": 10245,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "Koushirou...",
      "_offset": 10267,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Jou! Pull yourself together!",
      "_offset": 10280,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "This is the best! This is\ndefinitely the best!",
      "_offset": 10309,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Why's he clapping like a machine?",
      "_offset": 10356,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Don't do that...",
      "_offset": 10390,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Yay! Yay!",
      "_offset": 10407,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "Takeru! What's going on?",
      "_offset": 10417,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "Seems like he can't hear you.",
      "_offset": 10442,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "It's like everyone's lost their\nemotions.",
      "_offset": 10472,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Their Digimon should be with them,\nbut I haven't seen them at all...",
      "_offset": 10514,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "Welcome to Toy Town!",
      "_offset": 10583,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "He's back!",
      "_offset": 10604,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Mimi, Monzaemon's a really strong\nDigimon! We have to run!",
      "_offset": 10615,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "But...",
      "_offset": 10674,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "Time to erase the children's\nemotions and make them into toys\nfor the toys!",
      "_offset": 10681,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
